oke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-chevron-down\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform:rotate(0);transition:transform 0.2s\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"></path></svg></button></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:0.5rem\" class=\"hidden-mobile\"><a style=\"padding:0.5rem 1rem;color:#1a1a2e;text-decoration:none;font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:500;border-radius:0.4rem\" href=\"/login\">Log in</a><a style=\"padding:0.5rem 1.25rem;background-color:#2563eb;color:white;text-decoration:none;font-size:0.9rem;font-weight:600;border-radius:0.5rem\" href=\"/register\">Sign Up</a></div><button style=\"background:none;border:none;cursor:pointer;color:#1a1a2e;display:none\" class=\"show-mobile\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-menu\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 5h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 12h16\"></path><path d=\"M4 19h16\"></path></svg></button></div></div><style>\n        @media (max-width: 768px) { .hidden-mobile { display: none !important; } .show-mobile { display: block !important; } }\n        @media (min-width: 769px) { .show-mobile { display: none !important; } }\n      </style></nav><main><div style=\"background-color:white;color:#1a1a2e\"><section style=\"background-color:white;padding:5rem 1.5rem 4rem;text-align:center\"><div style=\"max-width:860px;margin:0 auto\"><h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(2.4rem, 5.5vw, 4rem);font-weight:800;color:#1a1a2e;line-height:1.15;margin-bottom:1.25rem;letter-spacing:-0.02em\">Find the Right Tutor. Learn with Confidence.</h1><p style=\"font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:600;color:#2563eb;margin-bottom:1.25rem;letter-spacing:0.01em\">TUTORS. Trusted. Transparent.</p><p style=\"font-size:1rem;color:#6b7280;max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 0.75rem;line-height:1.75\">Pakistan&#x27;s modern tutoring marketplace where parents and students<!-- --> <strong style=\"color:#1a1a2e\">search, compare, and book tutors</strong> <!-- -->for one-to-one learning—by subject, level, budget, and schedule.</p><p style=\"color:#9ca3af;margin-bottom:2.5rem;font-size:0.9rem\">No agents. No guesswork.</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:1rem;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap\"><a style=\"background-color:#2563eb;color:white;padding:0.85rem 2rem;border-radius:0.5rem;font-weight:600;font-size:1rem;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block\" href=\"/tutors\">Find a Tutor</a><a style=\"background-color:white;color:#1a1a2e;border:1.5px solid #d1d5db;padding:0.85rem 2rem;border-radius:0.5rem;font-weight:600;font-size:1rem;text-decoration:none;display:inline-block\" href=\"/become-a-tutor\">Become a Tutor</a></div></div></section><section style=\"padding:5rem 1.5rem;background-color:#f9fafb\"><div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto\"><div style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:3rem\"><h2 style=\"font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:#1a1a2e;margin-bottom:0.5rem\">Why TUTORERA®?</h2><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:1.05rem\">Because choosing a tutor shouldn&#x27;t feel risky.</p></div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));gap:1.5rem\"><div style=\"background-color:white;border-radius:0.875rem;padding:2rem;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);text-align:center;border:1px solid #f3f4f6\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:1rem\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-search\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m21 21-4.34-4.34\"></path><circle cx=\"11\" cy=\"11\" r=\"8\"></circle></svg></div><h3 style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem\">Search with Clarity</h3><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.6\">Search by subject, class, budget &amp; timing.</p></div><div style=\"background-color:white;border-radius:0.875rem;padding:2rem;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);text-align:center;border:1px solid #f3f4f6\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:1rem\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></div><h3 style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem\">Personalized Learning</h3><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.6\">One-to-one sessions tailored to your child&#x27;s needs.</p></div><div style=\"background-color:white;border-radius:0.875rem;padding:2rem;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);text-align:center;border:1px solid #f3f4f6\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:1rem\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg></div><h3 style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem\">Clear &amp; Safe Experience</h3><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.6\">A secure, monitored platform designed for parents who want clarity.</p></div><div style=\"background-color:white;border-radius:0.875rem;padding:2rem;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);text-align:center;border:1px solid #f3f4f6\"><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:center;margin-bottom:1rem\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"28\" height=\"28\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h3 style=\"font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem\">Built for Pakistan</h3><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.6\">Designed for Pakistan&#x27;s education systems and curricula.</p></div></div><p style=\"text-align:center;color:#9ca3af;margin-top:2rem;font-size:0.875rem\">TUTORERA® replaces informal tuition with a clear, modern marketplace.</p></div></section><section style=\"padding:5rem 1.5rem;background-color:white\"><div style=\"max-width:800px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center\"><h2 style=\"font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:#1a1a2e;margin-bottom:0.5rem\">Book the Best Tutors at your convenience.</h2><p style=\"color:#6b7280;margin-bottom:3.5rem;font-size:1rem\">Simple. Clear. Reliable.</p><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));gap:3rem\"><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem\"><div style=\"width:60px;height:60px;background-color:#1a1a2e;color:white;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:800\">1</div><h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e\">Search</h3><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.6\">Tell us what you need—subject, level, schedule, budget.</p></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem\"><div style=\"width:60px;height:60px;background-color:#1a1a2e;color:white;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:800\">2</div><h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e\">Compare</h3><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.6\">Review tutor profiles and choose what fits best.</p></div><div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;gap:0.75rem\"><div style=\"width:60px;height:60px;background-color:#1a1a2e;color:white;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:1.4rem;font-weight:800\">3</div><h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e\">Learn</h3><p style=\"color:#6b7280;font-size:0.875rem;line-height:1.6\">Book one-to-one sessions and start learning.</p></div></div></div></section><section style=\"padding:5rem 1.5rem;background-color:#f9fafb\"><div style=\"max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto\"><h2 style=\"font-size:2rem;font-weight:800;color:#1a1a2e;text-align:center;margin-bottom:3rem\">Built for the Entire Learning Community</h2><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));gap:1.5rem\"><div style=\"background-color:white;border-radius:0.875rem;padding:2rem;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;box-shadow:0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);transition:box-shadow 0.2s\"><div style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"26\" height=\"26\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#2563eb\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-book-open\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 7v14\"></path><path d=\"M3 18a1 1 0 0 1-1-1V4a1 1 0 0 1 1-1h5a4 4 0 0 1 4 4 4 4 0 0 1 4-4h5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v13a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-6a3 3 0 0 0-3 3 3 3 0 0 0-3-3z\"></path></svg></div><h3 style=\"font-size:1.1rem;font-weight:700;color:#1a1a2e;margin-bottom:1.25rem\">For Students</h3><ul style=\"list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:0.6rem\"><li s